{"seq":2,"slug":"vocabulary-review","title":"高三英语 — 词汇总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/vocabulary-review","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-词汇总复习\">高三英语 — 词汇总复习</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>词汇是英语所有能力的基石。高考英语大纲要求掌握约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3500</span></span></span></span></span> 个词汇，其中核心高频词约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 个，这些词在阅读理解、完形填空、语法填空和写作中反复出现。高三词汇复习的目标不是&quot;认识更多生词&quot;，而是&quot;深化已知词汇的用法&quot;——从&quot;认识&quot;到&quot;会用&quot;，从&quot;单一义项&quot;到&quot;多义辨析&quot;，从&quot;孤立记忆&quot;到&quot;语境运用&quot;。最后冲刺阶段的词汇策略应该是&quot;巩固高频词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 攻克易混词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 积累写作高级词汇&quot;三管齐下。</p>\n<p>词汇掌握的四个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认读</td>\n<td>看到能认出意思</td>\n<td>阅读理解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辨析</td>\n<td>区分近义词的细微差别</td>\n<td>完形填空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搭配</td>\n<td>知道与哪些词搭配使用</td>\n<td>语法填空、写作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产出</td>\n<td>能在写作和口语中主动使用</td>\n<td>写作、续写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-核心高频动词\">一、核心高频动词</h3><p>高考最常考的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频动词及其核心搭配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动词</th>\n<th>核心搭配</th>\n<th>易错点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>make</td>\n<td>make a difference / make sense / make up for</td>\n<td>make sb. do（不用 to）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>take</td>\n<td>take part in / take place / take advantage of / take it for granted</td>\n<td>take place 无被动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>turn</td>\n<td>turn out / turn to / turn down / turn up</td>\n<td>turn out to be 结果是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>come</td>\n<td>come up with / come across / come true</td>\n<td>come true 无被动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>get</td>\n<td>get along with / get over / get rid of / get used to</td>\n<td>get used to doing（to 是介词）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>put</td>\n<td>put forward / put off / put up with</td>\n<td>put off doing 推迟做</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>break</td>\n<td>break down / break out / break through</td>\n<td>break out 无被动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bring</td>\n<td>bring about / bring up / bring out</td>\n<td>bring up 抚养/提出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>look</td>\n<td>look into / look up to / look forward to</td>\n<td>look forward to doing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>set</td>\n<td>set off / set up / set out to do</td>\n<td>set out to do = set about doing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"二-高频词的多义辨析\">二、高频词的多义辨析</h3><p>很多高考考查的词汇不是&quot;难词&quot;，而是&quot;常见词的不常见义项&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>词汇</th>\n<th>常见义</th>\n<th>高考义</th>\n<th>例句</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>address</td>\n<td>地址</td>\n<td>解决（问题）/演讲</td>\n<td>We need to address this issue.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cover</td>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n<td>涉及/报道/走过（距离）</td>\n<td>The book covers many topics.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>draw</td>\n<td>画画</td>\n<td>吸引/得出（结论）</td>\n<td>The event drew a large crowd.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>figure</td>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td>人物/想出</td>\n<td>I can&#39;t figure out the answer.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lead</td>\n<td>引导</td>\n<td>导致</td>\n<td>Poor diet can lead to health problems.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>meet</td>\n<td>遇见</td>\n<td>满足/符合</td>\n<td>The product meets our needs.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>run</td>\n<td>跑</td>\n<td>经营/运转</td>\n<td>She runs a small business.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>save</td>\n<td>保存/救</td>\n<td>节省</td>\n<td>This method saves a lot of time.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>serve</td>\n<td>服务</td>\n<td>起……作用</td>\n<td>The bridge serves as a landmark.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>stand</td>\n<td>站</td>\n<td>忍受/代表</td>\n<td>I can&#39;t stand the noise. / UN stands for...</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-易混词辨析专题\">三、易混词辨析专题</h3><p>完形填空和写作中经常涉及近义词辨析，以下是高考高频易混词对：</p>\n<p><strong>看相关</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>see 看见（结果）/ look 看（动作）/ watch 观看（持续）/ observe 观察（仔细）/ notice 注意到（无意中）/ stare 盯着看</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>说相关</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>say 说内容 / speak 说语言/发言 / talk 交谈（talk to/with）/ tell 告诉（tell sb. sth.）/ inform 通知（正式）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>花费相关</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>spend 人 + spend + 时间/金钱 + on sth. / (in) doing sth.</li>\n<li>cost 物 + cost + 人 + 金钱</li>\n<li>take It takes sb. + 时间 + to do sth.</li>\n<li>pay 人 + pay + 金钱 + for sth.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>旅行相关</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>travel 旅行（泛指）/ trip 短途旅行 / journey 长途旅程 / tour 观光旅游 / voyage 航海旅行</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-写作高级词汇替换\">四、写作高级词汇替换</h3><p>写作中使用高级词汇替换基础词汇能显著提升语言分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基础词</th>\n<th>高级替换</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>think</td>\n<td>hold the view that / be convinced that / it occurs to me that</td>\n<td>I am convinced that education matters.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>important</td>\n<td>vital / essential / crucial / significant</td>\n<td>Education plays a vital role in society.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>good</td>\n<td>outstanding / remarkable / extraordinary</td>\n<td>She has an outstanding academic record.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bad</td>\n<td>terrible / dreadful / appalling</td>\n<td>The living conditions were appalling.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>like</td>\n<td>be fond of / be keen on / have a passion for</td>\n<td>I have a passion for music.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>many</td>\n<td>a great number of / numerous / a multitude of</td>\n<td>Numerous studies have shown...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>very</td>\n<td>extremely / remarkably / incredibly</td>\n<td>The view was incredibly beautiful.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>because</td>\n<td>owing to / due to / on account of</td>\n<td>Due to the heavy rain, the match was cancelled.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>but</td>\n<td>nevertheless / nonetheless / on the contrary</td>\n<td>Nevertheless, the situation improved.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>so</td>\n<td>consequently / as a result / therefore</td>\n<td>As a result, the project was a success.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-词汇记忆策略\">五、词汇记忆策略</h3><p>高三冲刺阶段不适合&quot;从头背单词书&quot;，而应采用以下高效策略：</p>\n<p><strong>策略一：真题词汇法</strong></p>\n<p>从近五年高考真题中提取所有不认识或用法不确定的词汇，按照考查频率排序，重点攻克高频词。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：词族扩展法</strong></p>\n<p>以一个核心词为中心，扩展其词族：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心词</th>\n<th>名词</th>\n<th>形容词</th>\n<th>副词</th>\n<th>动词</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>create</td>\n<td>creation / creativity / creator</td>\n<td>creative</td>\n<td>creatively</td>\n<td>create</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>success</td>\n<td>success</td>\n<td>successful</td>\n<td>successfully</td>\n<td>succeed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>differ</td>\n<td>difference</td>\n<td>different</td>\n<td>differently</td>\n<td>differ</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>策略三：语境记忆法</strong></p>\n<p>将词汇放在真实的句子或语境中记忆，而非孤立地记&quot;英语 = 中文&quot;。</p>\n<p>例：不要只记 &quot;address = 地址&quot;，而是同时记住 &quot;address a problem 解决问题&quot; 和 &quot;deliver an address 发表演讲&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>策略四：每日微量法</strong></p>\n<p>每天复习 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 个词汇（含复习旧词和学习新词），坚持到高考。小量高频优于大量低频。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-语法填空中的词汇变形规则\">六、语法填空中的词汇变形规则</h3><p>语法填空中词性转换是必考题型。掌握以下变形规则：</p>\n<p><strong>名词变复数的特殊形式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>辅音字母 + y</td>\n<td>变 y 为 i 加 es</td>\n<td>city → cities</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>以 f/fe 结尾</td>\n<td>变 f/fe 为 ves</td>\n<td>life → lives</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不规则变化</td>\n<td>需单独记忆</td>\n<td>child → children, mouse → mice</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>形容词/副词的比较级和最高级</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>比较级</th>\n<th>最高级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单音节</td>\n<td>加 -er</td>\n<td>加 -est</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多音节</td>\n<td>more + 原级</td>\n<td>most + 原级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不规则</td>\n<td>good → better, bad → worse</td>\n<td>good → best, bad → worst</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>从最近一次高考真题中抽取完形填空的所有四选一词汇，归类为&quot;动词辨析&quot;&quot;形容词辨析&quot;&quot;名词辨析&quot;等，每类总结辨析规律。</li>\n<li>用&quot;词族扩展法&quot;为以下核心词各写出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 种词性形式：develop, communicate, compete, responsible。</li>\n<li>将以下基础表达替换为高级表达：①&quot;I think this is a good idea.&quot;②&quot;There are many people in the park.&quot;③&quot;He is very tired because he worked all day.&quot;</li>\n<li>整理你的&quot;个人易混词清单&quot;——列出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 对你经常混淆的词汇，写出辨析要点和各一个例句。</li>\n<li>限时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，不查字典，写一篇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 词的短文介绍你的学校，尽量使用高级词汇替换基础词。写完后标出所有可以升级的词汇。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>词汇学习的&quot;间隔重复&quot;（Spaced Repetition）理论已被大量研究证实有效，Anki 等闪卡工具利用的就是这一原理。</li>\n<li>英英词典（如 Oxford Advanced Learner&#39;s Dictionary）的释义方式有助于建立&quot;英语思维&quot;，避免&quot;英汉对照&quot;的思维惯性。</li>\n<li>高频学术词汇表（Academic Word List）收录了大学和高考常见的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>570</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">570</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">570</span></span></span></span></span> 个词族，与高考核心词汇有高度重合。</li>\n<li>词根词缀是英语词汇的&quot;元素周期表&quot;——掌握 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 个常见词根和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 个常见词缀，就能推测数千个英语单词的含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高三词汇复习的核心策略是&quot;深度优于广度&quot;。核心高频动词的搭配用法（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频动词的多种搭配）、高频词的多义辨析（常见词的不常见义项）、近义词辨析（完形填空高频考点）和写作高级词汇替换（提升写作语言分）是四个重点突破方向。记忆策略上，真题词汇法最有针对性，词族扩展法最系统，语境记忆法最持久，每日微量法最可持续。最后冲刺阶段不要贪多求全，而是将最高频的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 个词汇吃透——认得出、辨得清、搭得对、用得上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 词汇总复习","id":"高三英语-词汇总复习"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、核心高频动词","id":"一-核心高频动词"},{"level":3,"text":"二、高频词的多义辨析","id":"二-高频词的多义辨析"},{"level":3,"text":"三、易混词辨析专题","id":"三-易混词辨析专题"},{"level":3,"text":"四、写作高级词汇替换","id":"四-写作高级词汇替换"},{"level":3,"text":"五、词汇记忆策略","id":"五-词汇记忆策略"},{"level":3,"text":"六、语法填空中的词汇变形规则","id":"六-语法填空中的词汇变形规则"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 语法总复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/grammar-review"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 写作模板","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/language-review/writing-templates"}}